{
    "title": "Stick Red and Blue 3",
    "description": "Good news for stickman red boy and blue girl game fans. Special edition version of the game has officially launched. With many exciting new improvements and challenges that will make you addicted and unable to take your eyes off.\r\n\r\nStick Red and Blue 3 is an addictive puzzle game where you have to synchronize two stickman. Control both Red Boy and Blue Girl at the same time and use the buttons to move, push boxes and collect coins to reach the exit in the forest.\r\n\r\nLike Water and Fire, the red boy and blue girl went out together in the forest, there are a lot of traps here and must overcome them before they can go home. They have to solve many tasks of the maze puzzle.\r\n\r\nFEATURE\r\n- Graphics, effects and sound are carefully equipped and perfect.\r\n- We will update new exciting challenges every week, helping you experience different challenges and increase the fun.\r\n- Easy but addictive teamwork gameplay\r\n- Smooth control\r\n- Download the game completely free.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY\r\nMove red boy and blue girl by arrows and avoid obstacles. Red boy must avoid the blue water while Blue girl must avoid the red water.\r\n- Just tap the button \"Change\" to change from Blue girl stick to Red boy\r\n- Collect coin as many as possible\r\n\r\nHelp Hotboy and Coolgirl get through each level quickly in this challenging game. Do not waste your time, and get started your journey right away!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Good news for stickman red boy and blue girl game fans. Special edition version of the game has officially launched. With many exciting new improvements and challenges that will make you addicted and unable to take your eyes off.<br><br>Stick Red and Blue 3 is an addictive puzzle game where you have to synchronize two stickman. Control both Red Boy and Blue Girl at the same time and use the buttons to move, push boxes and collect coins to reach the exit in the forest.<br><br>Like Water and Fire, the red boy and blue girl went out together in the forest, there are a lot of traps here and must overcome them before they can go home. They have to solve many tasks of the maze puzzle.<br><br>FEATURE<br>- Graphics, effects and sound are carefully equipped and perfect.<br>- We will update new exciting challenges every week, helping you experience different challenges and increase the fun.<br>- Easy but addictive teamwork gameplay<br>- Smooth control<br>- Download the game completely free.<br><br>HOW TO PLAY<br>Move red boy and blue girl by arrows and avoid obstacles. Red boy must avoid the blue water while Blue girl must avoid the red water.<br>- Just tap the button &quot;Change&quot; to change from Blue girl stick to Red boy<br>- Collect coin as many as possible<br><br>Help Hotboy and Coolgirl get through each level quickly in this challenging game. Do not waste your time, and get started your journey right away!",
